meta {
  name: 13 - Manual Block Debug
  seq: 14
}

docs {
  Manual/debug requests for BACK-3 manual block containment.
  
  Typical local flow:
  1. Run "01-happy-path" through request 20 "Get First Chat" to create a match and an active first chat.
  2. Optionally run requests 21 and 22 to exchange first-chat messages.
  3. Run "01 User A Block Match During Active First Chat" from this folder.
  
  The request uses:
  - {{matchId}} from matchmaking.
  - {{userAId}} as the authenticated blocker through X-Dev-User-Id.
  
  Expected behavior:
  - First run returns 201 Created with source MANUAL.
  - Replay returns 200 OK with the same block id.
  - The active first chat is cancelled with USER_BLOCK and the match is rejected by backend containment.
  
  This folder is intentionally separate from the main happy path because executing the block command stops the pair from progressing further.
}
